        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2011 PGA Championship\n- People: Keegan Bradley, Jason Dufner\n- Places: Atlanta Athletic Club, Johns Creek, Georgia, Fulton County, Atlanta\n- Sports venues: Highlands Course\n\nFacts:\n- The 2011 PGA Championship was the 93rd PGA Championship and was held from August 11 to August 14, 2011.\n- The 2011 PGA Championship took place at the Atlanta Athletic Club in Johns Creek, Georgia, a suburb northeast of Atlanta.\n- Keegan Bradley won the 2011 PGA Championship, his first major championship, in a three-hole playoff over Jason Dufner.\n- The playoff at the 2011 PGA Championship was played on the Highlands Course.\n- Johns Creek is a city in Fulton County in the U.S. state of Georgia.",
